curriculum.description_placeholder:
The educational programme is designed to train highly qualified specialists capable of solving complex specialized tasks and practical problems in their professional field. It combines a solid theoretical foundation with hands-on work on real projects guided by experienced lecturers.

Throughout their studies, students:

- master modern programming languages, frameworks and development tools;
- design and build information systems for a wide range of purposes;
- work with databases, cloud services and artificial intelligence technologies;
- develop teamwork and IT project management skills.

**Graduates of the programme** go on to work as developers, system analysts, QA engineers, database administrators and IT project managers in both Ukrainian and international companies.
